{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50895","headline":"赠刘台处士 · 王贞白","name":"赠刘台处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摆落尘埃深处隐，欲将麋鹿混高踨。\n兵机不让韩擒虎，笑癖微方陆士龙。\n月窟常留丹桂在，家山贪卧白云重。\n寻址朝有诏徵遗逸，莫挂头冠着涧松。\n（以上见《永乐大典》卷一三四五○「二寘」「处士」〖十四函一百三十七册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}